@model WikidataCiteView
@* Why the commands leave out main subject (P921): the taxon's Wikidata item may not be the
   taxon's (WikidataCiteView.MainSubjectLeftOut, TaxonItemDoubt). *@
@if (Model.MainSubjectLeftOut is { } doubt) {
    <p class="wikidata-main-subject">@(doubt.Kind == TaxonItemDoubtKind.SeveralItems
        ? SiteText.MainSubjectSeveralItems(doubt.ItemCount, doubt.TaxonId)
        : SiteText.MainSubjectDeprecated(doubt.TaxonItemQid, doubt.TaxonId))</p>
}
